  "what": "Per-hospital calibration of the structured model (seed 42), pooled from the five out-of-fold prediction sets so every image is scored exactly once by a model that did not train on it. Confidence = max softmax over the 6 decoded classes. Intervals are patient-clustered (2000 replicates).",
  "why": "The committed calibration is pooled over all hospitals. A pooled ECE on a corpus where one site supplies 64% of images reports that site. Every served threshold assumes a probability means the same thing everywhere.",
